<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Holderbank cut at CSFB.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Holderbank cut at CSFB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss cement maker Holderbank was cut to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;strong buy&quot; at CS First Boston, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>CSFB said it cut earnings estimates due to a deterioration in the outlook for some operations and to currency factors, with its 1997 earnings per share estimate cut to 533 Swiss francs from 585. Its 1988 estimate was cut to 643 Swiss francs from 650.</p>
<p>However the investment bank retained a price target of 1,300 Swiss francs on the stock.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
